# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit a key.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# The app BOOTS AND DEMOS WITHOUT ANY OF THESE, on mock data. You only need the
# Anthropic key once you're implementing /api/report or the enrich pipeline.

# --- Required for real Claude output ----------------------------------------
# Server-side only. Note: NO NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix. Prefixing it would ship the
# key to the browser (CLAUDE.md rule 4). Get one at console.anthropic.com.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Embeddings -------------------------------------------------------------
# None. Deliberate: embeddings run locally via @xenova/transformers
# (Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2), so there is no second key and no per-query cost.

# --- Optional stretch: Supabase ---------------------------------------------
# NOT used by the demo and NOT to be added without a team decision (CLAUDE.md
# rule 1). Only relevant if we ever accept user-submitted startups.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
